      "content": "It sounds like the guilt of your family's past is becoming a cage you can't escape, and the pressure to \"fix\" everything is crushing you. You are right that the weight feels unbearable, but the only way to truly stop the damage is to let go of the impossible expectation to carry it all alone. Instead of trying to be \"good\" in a way that feels like a failure, focus on protecting your own peace and finding a way to be kind to yourself. The cycle doesn't need to end with your life; it can end with your choices to stop repeating the pain.",
